~ start
$> TaskManager.give_task("compliment_johnny", "Faça Johnny feliz!")
Johnny: [[Hi|Hello|Howdy]], this is some dialogue.
Johnny: Here are some choices.
- hello beautiful
	$> TaskManager.complete_task("compliment_johnny")
	Johnny:[#mood=HAPPY] WHOA MAMA!!
- ...
	Johnny: taking a good look at my beautiful biceps, eh?
- Start again => start
- End the conversation => END
Johnny: [#mood=SAD]For more information see the online documentation, dollface!
=> END